#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/bugs/BugManager.java:67
msgid ""
"FrostWire was unable to write a necessary file because your hard drive is "
"full. To continue using FrostWire you must free up space on your hard drive."
msgstr ""
"FrostWire no pudo escribir un archivo requerido debido a que no hay espacio "
"disponible en su disco duro. Para continuar usando FrostWire debe liberar "
"espacio en su disco duro."

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/bugs/BugManager.java:69
msgid ""
"FrostWire was unable to open a necessary file because another program has "
"locked the file. FrostWire may act unexpectedly until this file is released."
msgstr ""
"FrostWire no pudo abrir un archivo necesario porque otro programa lo ha "
"bloqueado. FrostWire puede funcionar de manera inesperada hasta que este "
"archivo sea liberado."

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/bugs/BugManager.java:71
msgid ""
"FrostWire was unable to write a necessary file because you do not have the "
